msgid "Get trusted WordPress add-ons. Guaranteed to work fast, safe to use, beautifully coded, packed with features, and are easy to use."
msgstr "Get trusted WordPress add-ons. Guaranteed ke work fast, safe ke use, beautifully coded, packed dengan features, dan easy ke use."

msgid "Save big today with an exclusive membership plan!"
msgstr "Hemat lebih banyak hari ini dengan paket keanggotaan eksklusif!"

msgid "show bundle pack"
msgstr "tampilkan paket bundel"

msgid "Add agents and assign roles and permissions to provide assistance and support for customer support tickets."
msgstr "Tambahkan agen serta tetapkan peran dan izin untuk memberikan bantuan dan dukungan pada tiket pelanggan."

msgid "buy now"
msgstr "beli sekarang"

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Terinstal"

msgid "Create multiple custom ticket forms with different custom fields for each request type that you support."
msgstr "Buat beberapa formulir tiket khusus dengan kolom khusus berbeda untuk setiap jenis permintaan yang Anda dukung."

msgid "Email piping is the process of automatically turning incoming emails into support tickets without manual data entry."
msgstr "Email Piping adalah proses mengubah email masuk menjadi tiket dukungan secara otomatis tanpa entri data manual."

msgid "Make the ticket assignment process automatic and assign the most qualified agent to your tickets with conditions."
msgstr "Otomatiskan proses penetapan tiket dan tetapkan agen yang paling sesuai ke tiket Anda berdasarkan kondisi."

msgid "Add private notes to a ticket and share crucial information internally with your agents, this private note is not visible to the customer."
msgstr "Tambahkan catatan privat pada tiket dan bagikan informasi penting secara internal dengan agen Anda. Catatan privat ini tidak terlihat oleh pelanggan."

msgid "Merge one or more tickets into another if you receive two support requests from the same end user about the same issue."
msgstr "Gabungkan satu atau beberapa tiket ke tiket lain jika Anda menerima dua permintaan dukungan dari pengguna akhir yang sama tentang masalah yang sama."

msgid "The user can search for and choose the topic for which they need help using help topics"
msgstr "Pengguna dapat mencari dan memilih topik bantuan yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan mereka."

msgid "Manage abandoned tickets, and set rules for tickets over time, and those tickets will be closed automatically after a certain period."
msgstr "Kelola tiket yang terbengkalai dan atur aturan berdasarkan waktu; tiket tersebut akan otomatis ditutup setelah periode tertentu."

msgid "Stop wasting time on repetitive inquiries, build your knowledge base, and organize your solutions into categories for users."
msgstr "Hentikan pemborosan waktu pada pertanyaan berulang, bangun basis pengetahuan Anda, dan atur solusi ke dalam kategori untuk pengguna."

msgid "Define rules or set a specific time interval for making tickets automatically overdue."
msgstr "Define rules atau atur specific time interval untuk making tiket automatically lewat jatuh tempo."

msgid "Track the amount of time spent on each customer support ticket without losing focus and enhance team productivity."
msgstr "Track amount of time spent pada each pelanggan tiket dukungan tanpa losing focus dan enhance team productivity."

msgid "Show the whole history of the ticket, including its status and any action taken in response to it."
msgstr "Tampilkan whole history of tiket, including its status dan any action taken di response ke it."

msgid "The simplest approach to effectively manage payments for premium help is through paid support."
msgstr "simplest approach ke effectively kelola payments untuk premium help through dukungan berbayar."

msgid "Customers will enter sensitive information on tickets, and this add-on is designed to help you keep that information secure."
msgstr "Pelanggan akan memasukkan informasi sensitif pada tiket, dan add-on ini dirancang untuk membantu Anda menjaga informasi tersebut tetap aman."

msgid "Empowers users to provide clear and concise explanations for why customer service tickets are being closed."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengguna memberikan penjelasan yang jelas dan ringkas tentang alasan tiket layanan pelanggan ditutup."

msgid "Get AI-powered, context-based suggestions to effortlessly create clear, relevant, and helpful replies."
msgstr "Get AI-powered, context-based suggestions ke effortlessly buat clear, relevant, dan helpful balasan."

msgid "Make ready-made responses to the most common questions in the tickets to swiftly address client issues."
msgstr "Make ready-made responses ke most common questions di tiket ke swiftly address client issues."

msgid "max ticket"
msgstr "max tiket"

msgid "Admins can limit the number of tickets that users can create as well as the number of tickets that agents can open individually."
msgstr "Admin dapat membatasi jumlah tiket yang dapat dibuat pengguna serta jumlah tiket yang dapat dibuka agen secara individual."

msgid "To enhance the quality of your services, ask your customers to complete a survey when a ticket is closed."
msgstr "Untuk meningkatkan kualitas layanan, minta pelanggan menyelesaikan survei saat tiket ditutup."

msgid "Ticket action options allow you to execute additional actions on tickets."
msgstr "Tiket action options izinkan Anda ke execute additional actions pada tiket."

msgid "Easily export ticket data and performance report data from your majestic support to an Excel spreadsheet with our efficient and user-friendly solution."
msgstr "Ekspor data tiket dan data laporan performa dari Majestic Support ke lembar kerja Excel dengan solusi kami yang efisien dan ramah pengguna."

msgid "Send the exact copy of the email to the provided email address with Email CC or BCC."
msgstr "Send exact copy of email ke provided alamat email dengan Email CC atau BCC."

msgid "User options enable you to define roles for new users when they are registered."
msgstr "Opsi pengguna memungkinkan Anda menentukan peran untuk pengguna baru saat mereka terdaftar."

msgid "SMTP enables you to add  custom mail protocols to send and receive emails with the support ticket system."
msgstr "SMTP memungkinkan Anda menambahkan protokol email khusus untuk mengirim dan menerima email melalui sistem tiket dukungan."

msgid "Multi Language Email Templates"
msgstr "Multi Bahasa Templat Emails"

msgid "Create multi-language email templates for all default email templates to send customers emails in the language that they prefer."
msgstr "Buat templat email multibahasa untuk semua templat email bawaan agar pelanggan menerima email dalam bahasa yang mereka pilih."

msgid "Downloads can be very helpful for users who are looking to obtain the necessary information to resolve issues."
msgstr "Downloads dapat be very helpful untuk pengguna who looking ke obtain necessary information ke resolve issues."

msgid "Make an unlimited number of announcements related to the support system to encourage customer interaction."
msgstr "Buat pengumuman tanpa batas terkait sistem dukungan untuk mendorong interaksi pelanggan."

msgid "With Ban Email, you can limit a users ability to create new tickets by blocking their email address."
msgstr "Dengan fitur Blokir Email, Anda dapat membatasi kemampuan pengguna membuat tiket baru dengan memblokir alamat email mereka."

msgid "Provide answers to common user questions with the FAQ extension before they become tickets."
msgstr "Provide answers ke common pengguna questions dengan FAQ extension before they become tiket."

msgid "Get immediate data on your support operations as soon as you log into your WordPress administration area."
msgstr "Dapatkan data langsung tentang operasi dukungan segera setelah Anda masuk ke area administrasi WordPress."

msgid "desktop notifications"
msgstr "notifikasi desktop"

msgid "You will be informed of anything that occurs on your support system by the desktop notifications."
msgstr "Anda akan diberi tahu tentang semua hal yang terjadi pada sistem dukungan melalui notifikasi desktop."

msgid "The integration of the support ticket system for WooCommerce with your e-shop makes your support better and more professional."
msgstr "Integrasi sistem tiket dukungan untuk WooCommerce dengan toko online Anda membuat dukungan lebih baik dan lebih profesional."

msgid "Manage your email marketing campaigns directly from your majestic support by adding new user accounts to your Mailchimp email list."
msgstr "Kelola kampanye pemasaran email langsung dari Majestic Support dengan menambahkan akun pengguna baru ke daftar email Mailchimp Anda."

msgid "Send messages internally about support tickets and other issues between agents with internal mail."
msgstr "Send messages internally about tiket dukungan dan other issues between agen dengan internal email."

msgid "frontend widget"
msgstr "widget front-end"

msgid "Frontend Widgets include several widgets that can be used to enhance the plugin's functionality in various areas of the website."
msgstr "Widget front-end mencakup beberapa widget yang dapat digunakan untuk meningkatkan fungsi plugin di berbagai area situs web."

